  "tour": {
    "title": "Bema: the judgment seat of Christ",
    "intro": "This short tour follows the word “bema” from its concrete setting in Corinth to Paul’s use of it for standing before Christ. It then slows down over the question many people carry with this image: should believers be terrified, and how should the coming judgment shape the way we live and evaluate one another?",
