        "endSec": 1325,
        "why": "Begin with the setting behind the word. The speaker explains that the “judgment seat is the Bama seat,” a public forum platform where the proconsul sat, and says Paul uses his Corinth experience as imagery for standing before Jesus.",
        "episodeTitle": "Acts 18:1-22",
