        "startSec": 1280,
        "endSec": 1411,
        "why": "This is the central exposition of 2 Corinthians 5:10. The speaker connects the bema to Paul’s aim “to please Jesus,” says each person will be accountable for what they have done, and argues that resurrection hope is meant to “fuel our faithfulness,” not become mere speculation.",
