        "startSec": 300,
        "endSec": 397,
        "why": "Now hear a pastoral response to the fear the bema can provoke. After quoting Romans 14 and 2 Corinthians 5:10, the speaker says plainly that faithful Christians “should not be afraid,” and warns that these passages are often used to scare people rather than read in context.",
        "episodeTitle": "Appearing Before the Judgment Seat of Christ",
