        "audioUrl": "https://substackcdn.com/video_upload/post/148682164/3bfa2147-52f2-4ac0-ab0d-cca3c3057420/transcoded.mp3?post_id=148682164&relation=podcast&Expires=1785437915&Key-Pair-Id=APKAIVDA3NPSMPSPESQQ&Signature=W9Vn6cGXQ2D1wUyIqDhNGmYOH-nJ3~NDL6epL3I77kSiHX4qwYTYP5cPBslo6yXMBmUrtqWipdM32hyXHZI92pToMQ3FXNClaxMbYDw41O55-xSpIwOQFtupaDLVoWWRhC6~yMm~1LBl0w9dZptkJCtcis-PFIav-2gRax88wLJmCdweTv4YdTFWQ4A-zs58TNZZcq3xH26O7ZefTYLwXY4veyt7NOCxB-coqHhoqi5prfvDgx67n29fqOrUmB76VwbTJonavWKulOeKienlsKabkn3nAQtVZXKGFmr1-jx7HeBoovw7cgJkDIUYiTRC1r9qvYHytTUC4Fabh5u8BA__",
        "durationSec": 2786,
