      {
        "recordId": "bibleproject:podcast:there-ever-time-judge-others",
        "startSec": 1815,
        "endSec": 1939,
        "why": "Close by showing one practical consequence of the bema. The hosts connect God’s future judgment—including the disclosure of “motives of men's hearts”—with Jesus’ and Paul’s warnings not to judge a brother, while distinguishing that from appropriately evaluating harmful behavior.",
